      "anchor": "arena_primary",
      "purpose": "fidelity",
      "note": "RI-MAG05 §B3 requests this viewpoint BY NAME: the HEAVY release frame (startup+1), gameplay camera transform, HUD off, fixed weather and time of day. M2 (local RMS contrast on a 256 px crop centred on the spell core), M5 (spectral slope on the smoke/spore crop), M8 (the flat-shading delta against the same viewpoint with no spell active) and M9 (tonemap response on the core) are all measured here, and so are VFX-SOFT and VFX-LIT.",
